+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is currently disabled in development builds. This was adopted as a temporary workaround for certificate/TLS configuration issues encountered during development and testing, not as a permanent policy, and it is intended to be re-enabled once the underlying certificate/TLS issue is resolved; verification remains required outside of development builds.
